ight:115%;text-autospace:none'><span\r\n  style='font-size:9.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>mIU\/mL<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr style='height:16.2pt'>\r\n  <td width=246 valign=top style='width:184.3pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:16.2pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:115%;text-autospace:none'><b><span\r\n  style='font-size:9.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>E3,\r\n  unconjugated Estriol*<\/span><\/b><span style='font-size:9.0pt;line-height:\r\n  115%;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'> <\/span><\/p>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:115%;text-autospace:none'><span\r\n  style='font-size:9.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>(CLIA)<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=227 valign=top style='width:6.0cm;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:16.2pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:115%'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\"Calibri\",sans-serif'>1.30<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=189 valign=top style='width:5.0cm;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:16.2pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:115%;text-autospace:none'><span\r\n  style='font-size:9.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>ng\/mL<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n<\/table>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><b><span\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt'>Risk factor calculated by*<\/span><\/b><b><span\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><\/b><span\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt'>PRISCA 5<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:9.0pt'>\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:9.0pt'>Please refer\r\nnext page for statistical calculation final report and interpretation<\/span><\/b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:9.0pt'>.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:9.0pt'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-36.0pt'><b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:9.0pt'>Test information:<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>1. Statistical risk\r\nfactor calculation for Trisomy 21 (Down's syndrome), Trisomy 18 (Edward\r\nSyndrome) &amp; Open Neural tube<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 defect has been done\r\nusing CE approved <b>PRISCA 5 <\/b>software<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>2. The statistical risk\r\nevaluation requires Maternal age to be decimalised for months, to be\r\nrepresented as Age at sampling &amp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 conversion of\r\nmaternal hormonal values to mean of medians(MOMs). The MoMs are further\r\ncalculated using Indian<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 medians, which are\r\nestablished in-house with database of more than 10000 patients and are\r\nperiodically updated.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>3. Statistical\r\nevaluation enclosed being more informative, the reference ranges for the biochemical\r\nparameters are not quoted<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 on the report. All\r\nsoftware may not give similar risk factor for the similar data.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>4. This is a screening\r\ntest and hence confirmation of screen positives is recommended.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>5. The test offers\r\ndetection rate of 81% and hence occasional false negatives are likely.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>6. It is advisable to\r\nask for repeat calculations (not the test), in case history provided is not\r\ncorrect. For better reliability of<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 results, it is\r\nadvised to carry out analysis between 15&amp;17 weeks.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>7. <b>Associated Test:\r\nIntegrated (Standard-NT, PAPPa, Quadruple screen) ) is available .<\/b><\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<table class=MsoNormalTable border=1 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0 align=left\r\n width=733 style='width:549.9pt;border-collapse:collapse;border:none;\r\n margin-left:6.75pt;margin-right:6.75pt;margin-bottom:7.75pt'>\r\n <tr style='height:19.5pt'>\r\n  <td width=121 valign=top style='width:90.9pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;height:19.5pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:115%;text-autospace:none'><b><span\r\n  style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Disorder <\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=270 valign=top style='width:202.5pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-left:none;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;height:19.5pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:115%;text-autospace:none'><b><span\r\n  style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Screen positive Cut off (ACOG\r\n  2007)<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=156 valign=top style='width:117.0pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-left:none;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;height:19.5pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:115%;text-autospace:none'><b><span\r\n  lang=EN-US style='font-size:9.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>MOM\r\n  Cut off(ACOG2007<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=186 valign=top style='width:139.5pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-left:none;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;height:19.5pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:115%;text-autospace:none'><b>Remarks<\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr style='height:19.5pt'>\r\n  <td width=121 valign=top style='width:90.9pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  border-top:none;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;height:19.5pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:115%'><span style='font-size:8.0pt;\r\n  line-height:115%;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Trisomy-21<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=270 valign=top style='width:202.5pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;height:19.5pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:115%'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:9.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>1:250<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=156 valign=top style='width:117.0pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  paddin